---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About — bbd.sh"
  description="bbd.sh is a small builder studio. We help founders, operators, and VCs validate ideas and ship them — full-stack engineering, AI tooling, and flexible terms."
>
  <section class="border-b border-ink/10">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted mb-2">
        ## about.md
      </p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight mb-10">
        Who we are
      </h1>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-ink/85 leading-relaxed space-y-6">
        <p>
          bbd.sh is a small builder studio.
          We believe a tight full-stack team plus modern AI tooling
          produces output well above its size.
        </p>

        <p>
          Our core team mixes senior engineering at scale with early-stage operating experience.
          We've shipped SaaS, AI agents, cross-border tooling, dApps, dev tools, and content products.
          Everyone here writes production code and can sit with a founder
          to talk customer and go-to-market.
        </p>

        <p>
          Our approach: <strong>treat AI as real leverage</strong>, not a marketing label.
          The time AI saves goes back into shaping the product until it can charge —
          not into endless sprint planning and standups.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold mt-12">What we believe</h2>

        <ul class="space-y-3 list-none pl-0">
          <li class="border-l-2 border-electric pl-4">
            <strong>Ship fast, iterate faster</strong> —
            first dollar on day one beats a 50-page plan, 100 times out of 100.
          </li>
          <li class="border-l-2 border-electric pl-4">
            <strong>AI is leverage, not replacement</strong> —
            the best engineers aren't the ones avoiding AI; they're the ones pushing it hardest.
          </li>
          <li class="border-l-2 border-electric pl-4">
            <strong>Capital-agnostic</strong> —
            bootstrapped, angel-backed, VC-backed — we work with all of them.
            What matters is whether the business can actually work.
          </li>
          <li class="border-l-2 border-electric pl-4">
            <strong>Transparent &gt; marketing</strong> —
            we publish progress, failures, and post-mortems.
            That's why our clients trust us.
          </li>
          <li class="border-l-2 border-electric pl-4">
            <strong>We turn down what we don't believe in</strong> —
            if we don't think it'll work, we'll say no rather than take your money.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold mt-12">What we don't do</h2>

        <ul class="space-y-2 list-none pl-0 font-mono text-sm">
          <li><span class="text-ember">✗</span> No PPT-only / deck-only projects</li>
          <li><span class="text-ember">✗</span> No hourly outsourcing</li>
          <li><span class="text-ember">✗</span> No grey-market or regulatory red-line work</li>
          <li><span class="text-ember">✗</span> No "wait until funding closes, then maybe start" loops</li>
          <li><span class="text-ember">✗</span> No engagements where neither side has skin in the game</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold mt-12">Why bbd.sh</h2>
        <p>
          <code class="bg-ink/5 px-2 py-1 font-mono text-sm">bbd</code> =
          <strong>Build · Bootstrap · Deliver</strong>.
          <br />
          <code class="bg-ink/5 px-2 py-1 font-mono text-sm">.sh</code> is the shell extension —
          we'd rather show running code than a keynote.
        </p>

        <p class="font-display text-2xl italic text-ink/70 mt-12 border-l-4 border-electric pl-6">
          "We're a builder studio. We help you find the business
          and ship it — on whatever terms make sense."
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-ink text-paper">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Want to talk?</h2>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-electric text-ink hover:bg-paper transition-colors rounded font-mono font-bold"
      >
        $ ./let-us-talk →
      </a>
      <p class="mt-4 font-mono text-xs text-paper/50">hello@bbd.sh</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
